小手 \n快乐没烦恼我们都是 \n好宝宝\n\n[Chorus]\n我是小太阳 \n闪闪亮笑容挂脸上 \n暖洋洋勇敢又善良 \n天天在成长快乐歌声 \n到处唱\n\n[Verse]\n\n参数吹得有多帅\n闭源的门就关多快\n竞品开源即巅峰\n你还在把借口掰\n开发者们纷纷离开\n信任碎成了石块\n所谓突破藏着掖着\n不过是自我澎湃\n\n[Bridge]\n\n课堂上认真 \n眼睛亮晶晶老师夸我棒 \n我更努力行课间做游戏 \n友谊记心里每一天都 \n有新意\n\n[Chorus]\n我是小太阳 \n闪闪亮笑容挂脸上 \n暖洋洋勇敢又善良 \n天天在成长快乐歌声 \n到处唱\n\n[Outro]\n啦啦啦啦啦 \n啦啦啦啦啦快乐小太阳 \n永远闪闪亮", "R&B, drum machine, powerful, epic, Keyboard, electronic，clean female voice", "3B", "oss", 151921707257115, "randomize", 50, 1, 1.5, 1.5, true, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "version"}, "name": "version", "label": "version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "version"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec_version"}, "name": "codec_version", "label": "codec_version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec_version"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, "name": "max_audio_length_seconds", "label": "max_audio_length_seconds", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "topk"}, "name": "topk", "label": "topk", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "topk"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "offload_mode"}, "name": "offload_mode", "label": "offload_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "offload_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantize_4bit"}, "name": "quantize_4bit", "label": "quantize_4bit", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "quantize_4bit"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "HeartMuLa_Generate", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "HeartMuLa_Generate"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 106], "color": "#432", "pos": [-1378.3223876953125, 593.7612915039062], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "01歌曲生成区", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [210, 106], "color": "#2a363b", "pos": [-1453.183349609375, 1666.9979248046875], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "歌词识别", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.2872619628906, 274.8255920410156], "pos": [-365.6259460449219, 952.6250610351562], "id": 6, "proper